	(text "Notes: \n1) GND and GND_24V are reversed from the power supply, drawn as found.  This is \n   likely an error in the original design.  See note on power supply schematic \n   for correction information.\n2) J2-11, J2-16, J2-17, J2-29 are NC.  Serial board connects them to +5V or GND.  \n   J2-36 is the only +5V and J2-28 is the only GND\n3) J5 Option G is the low tape sensor.  Not installed on sample unit, defaults to \"OK\""
		(exclude_from_sim no)
